      showConfirmModal('ยืนยันลบข้อมูล', 'คุณต้องการลบข้อมูลคุณแม่ท่านนี้ออกจากระบบ Admin หรือไม่?', (confirmed) => {
        if (confirmed) {
          const patient = appState.adminPatients.find(p => p.id === id);
          if (patient && (patient.name === appState.name && patient.ward === appState.ward)) {
            clearActivePatientData();
          }
          appState.adminPatients = appState.adminPatients.filter(p => p.id !== id);
          saveState();
          renderAdminDashboard();
          showToast('ลบข้อมูลคุณแม่เรียบร้อย');
        }
      });
    }

    /* ฟังก์ชันเสร็จสิ้นการดูแลคุณแม่ */
    function completePatient(patientId) {
      const patient = appState.adminPatients.find(p => p.id === patientId);
      const patientName = patient ? patient.name : 'คุณแม่';
      
      showConfirmModal(
        'ยืนยันเสร็จสิ้นการดูแล', 
        `คุณต้องการบันทึกเสร็จสิ้นการดูแลคุณแม่ "${patientName}" และนำข้อมูลออกจากรายการติดตามใช่หรือไม่?`, 
        (confirmed) => {
          if (confirmed) {
            // หากคุณแม่ที่เสร็จสิ้นตรงกับคุณแม่ที่เปิดอยู่ในปัจจุบัน ให้เคลียร์ข้อมูลหน้าหลักด้วย
            if (patient && (patient.name === appState.name && patient.ward === appState.ward)) {
              clearActivePatientData();
            }

            // ลบออกจากรายการในระบบ Admin
            appState.adminPatients = appState.adminPatients.filter(p => p.id !== patientId);
            saveState();
            renderAdminDashboard();
            showToast(`เสร็จสิ้นการดูแลคุณแม่ ${patientName} เรียบร้อยแล้ว`);
          }
        }
      );
    }

    /* เคลียร์ข้อมูลคุณแม่ในหน้าหลัก (Input Form, Result, Tracker) */
    function clearActivePatientData() {
      appState.name = '';
      appState.hn = '';
      appState.ward = '';
      appState.bed = '';
      appState.deliveryType = '';
      appState.district = '';
      appState.recordDate = null;
      appState.symptoms = '';
      appState.assessmentScore = null;
      appState.assessmentAlert = false;
      appState.lastAssessedTime = null;
      appState.massagedStimulate = null;
      appState.massagedUnclog = null;
      appState.lastMassageType = null;
      appState.lastMassageTime = null;
      appState.lastActionMessage = null;
      appState.lastActionTime = null;
      appState.thaiMedAppt = null;
      appState.pumps = 0;
      appState.totalVolume = 0.0;
      appState.logs = [];
      appState.flowFollowUps = [];

      const nameInput = document.getElementById('patientName');
      const hnInput = document.getElementById('patientHn');
      const wardSelect = document.getElementById('patientWard');
      const bedInput = document.getElementById('patientBed');
      const deliverySelect = document.getElementById('patientDeliveryType');
      const districtSelect = document.getElementById('patientDistrict');
      if (nameInput) nameInput.value = '';
      if (hnInput) hnInput.value = '';
      if (wardSelect) wardSelect.value = '';
      if (bedInput) bedInput.value = '';
      if (deliverySelect) deliverySelect.value = '';
      if (districtSelect) districtSelect.value = '';

      const resCard = document.getElementById('assessmentResultCard');
      if (resCard) resCard.classList.add('hidden');

      updateTrackerUI();
      updateFlowMonitoringUI();
      updateCareStatusUI();
      renderThaiMedApptUI();
    }

    function exportAdminCSV() {
      let filtered = appState.adminPatients;
      if (appState.adminWardFilter && appState.adminWardFilter !== 'all') {
        filtered = filtered.filter(p => p.ward === appState.adminWardFilter);
      }

      if (filtered.length === 0) {
        showToast('ไม่มีข้อมูลสำหรับส่งออก');
        return;
      }

      let csv = "\uFEFF"; // UTF-8 BOM
      csv += "วันที่บันทึก,HN,ชื่อ-นามสกุล,ที่อยู่(อำเภอ),ตึก,เตียง,วิธีการคลอด,แพทย์แผนไทย,อาการ,นวดกระตุ้นน้ำนม,นวดเปิดท่อน้ำนม,รอบบีบสะสม,ปริมาณรวม(มล.),ติดตามทันที,ติดตาม 2 ชม.,ติดตาม 4 ชม.,เวลาประเมินล่าสุด\n";

      filtered.forEach(p => {
        const imm = p.flowFollowUps?.find(f => f.stage === 'หลังนวดทันที');
        const h2 = p.flowFollowUps?.find(f => f.stage === '2 ชั่วโมงหลังนวด');
        const h4 = p.flowFollowUps?.find(f => f.stage === '4 ชั่วโมงหลังนวด');

        const immText = imm ? `${imm.result} (${imm.volume} มล. เวลา ${imm.time})` : 'ยังไม่บันทึก';
        const h2Text = h2 ? `${h2.result} (${h2.volume} มล. เวลา ${h2.time})` : 'ยังไม่บันทึก';
        const h4Text = h4 ? `${h4.result} (${h4.volume} มล. เวลา ${h4.time})` : 'ยังไม่บันทึก';

        csv += `"${formatDateThai(p.recordDate) || '-'}","${p.hn || '-'}","${p.name}","${p.district || '-'}","${p.ward}","${p.bed || '-'}","${p.deliveryType || '-'}","${p.provider || '-'}","${p.symptoms || '-'}","${p.massagedStimulate || 'ยังไม่ได้นวด'}","${p.massagedUnclog || 'ยังไม่ได้นวด'}",${p.pumps || 0},${(p.totalVolume || 0).toFixed(1)},"${immText}","${h2Text}","${h4Text}","${p.lastAssessedTime || '-'}"\n`;
      });

      const blob = new Blob([csv], { type: 'text/csv;charset=utf-8;' });
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = url;
      a.download = `LactaCare_Report_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.csv`;
      document.body.appendChild(a);
      a.click();
      document.body.removeChild(a);
      showToast('ดาวน์โหลดไฟล์ CSV เรียบร้อย');
    }

    /* Modal & Photo Handling */
    function openBabyPhotoModal() {
      document.getElementById('babyModal')?.classList.remove('hidden');
    }

    function closeBabyPhotoModal() {
      document.getElementById('babyModal')?.classList.add('hidden');
    }

    function handleBabyPhotoUpload(event) {
      const file = event.target.files[0];
      if (file) {
        const reader = new FileReader();
        reader.onload = function(e) {
          appState.babyPhoto = e.target.result;
          const img = document.getElementById('babyPhotoPreview');
          if (img) img.src = appState.babyPhoto;
          saveState();
          showToast('อัปเดตรูปลูกเรียบร้อย');
        };
        reader.readAsDataURL(file);
      }
    }

    /* Confirm Modal */
    function showConfirmModal(title, msg, callback) {
      confirmCallback = callback;
      const titleEl = document.getElementById('confirmModalTitle');
      const msgEl = document.getElementById('confirmModalMessage');
      if (titleEl) titleEl.innerText = title;
      if (msgEl) msgEl.innerText = msg;
      document.getElementById('confirmModal')?.classList.remove('hidden');
    }

    function closeConfirmModal(result) {
      document.getElementById('confirmModal')?.classList.add('hidden');
      if (confirmCallback) {
        confirmCallback(result);
        confirmCallback = null;
      }
    }

    function confirmResetTracker() {
      showConfirmModal('ยืนยันล้างข้อมูล', 'คุณต้องการล้างรอบการบีบและปริมาณน้ำนมของวันนี้ใช่หรือไม่?', (confirmed) => {
        if (confirmed) {
          appState.pumps = 0;
          appState.totalVolume = 0.0;
          appState.logs = [];
          appState.flowFollowUps = [];
          saveState();
          syncCurrentPatientToAdminList();
          updateTrackerUI();
          updateFlowMonitoringUI();
          showToast('ล้างข้อมูลวันนี้เรียบร้อย');
        }
      });
    }

    /* Toast Notification Helper */
    function showToast(message) {
      const toast = document.getElementById('toastNotification');
      if (!toast) return;
      toast.innerText = message;
      toast.classList.remove('opacity-0', '-translate-y-2');
      toast.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');
      setTimeout(() => {
        toast.classList.remove('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');
        toast.classList.add('opacity-0', '-translate-y-2');
      }, 2500);
    }

    function saveState() {
      try {
        localStorage.setItem('lacta_first24_state_v2', JSON.stringify({
          name: appState.name,
          hn: appState.hn || '',
          ward: appState.ward,
          bed: appState.bed,
          deliveryType: appState.deliveryType || '',
          district: appState.district || '',
          recordDate: appState.recordDate || null,
          provider: appState.provider || '',
          symptoms: appState.symptoms,
          assessmentScore: appState.assessmentScore,
          assessmentAlert: appState.assessmentAlert,
          lastAssessedTime: appState.lastAssessedTime,
          massagedStimulate: appState.massagedStimulate,
          massagedUnclog: appState.massagedUnclog,
          lastMassageType: appState.lastMassageType,
          lastMassageTime: appState.lastMassageTime,
          lastActionMessage: appState.lastActionMessage || null,
          lastActionTime: appState.lastActionTime || null,
          thaiMedAppt: appState.thaiMedAppt || null,
          pumps: appState.pumps,
          totalVolume: appState.totalVolume,
          logs: appState.logs,
          flowFollowUps: appState.flowFollowUps || [],
          babyPhoto: appState.babyPhoto,
          adminPatients: appState.adminPatients
        }));
      } catch (e) {
        console.error('Storage save error:', e);
      }
    }

    function loadState() {
      try {
        const saved = localStorage.getItem('lacta_first24_state_v2');
        if (saved) {
          const parsed = JSON.parse(saved);
          appState.name = parsed.name || '';
          appState.hn = parsed.hn || '';
          appState.ward = parsed.ward || '';
          appState.bed = parsed.bed || '';
          appState.deliveryType = parsed.deliveryType || '';
          appState.district = parsed.district || '';
          appState.recordDate = parsed.recordDate || null;
          appState.provider = parsed.provider || '';
          appState.symptoms = parsed.symptoms || '';
          appState.assessmentScore = parsed.assessmentScore || null;
          appState.assessmentAlert = parsed.assessmentAlert || false;
          appState.lastAssessedTime = parsed.lastAssessedTime || null;
          appState.massagedStimulate = parsed.massagedStimulate || null;
          appState.massagedUnclog = parsed.massagedUnclog || null;
          appState.lastMassageType = parsed.lastMassageType || null;
          appState.lastMassageTime = parsed.lastMassageTime || null;
          appState.lastActionMessage = parsed.lastActionMessage || null;
          appState.lastActionTime = parsed.lastActionTime || null;
          appState.thaiMedAppt = parsed.thaiMedAppt || null;
          appState.pumps = parsed.pumps || 0;
          appState.totalVolume = parsed.totalVolume || 0.0;
          appState.logs = parsed.logs || [];
          appState.flowFollowUps = parsed.flowFollowUps || [];
          appState.babyPhoto = parsed.babyPhoto || null;
          appState.adminPatients = parsed.adminPatients || [];

          const nameInput = document.getElementById('patientName');
          if (nameInput && appState.name) nameInput.value = appState.name;

          const hnInput = document.getElementById('patientHn');
          if (hnInput && appState.hn) hnInput.value = appState.hn;

          const wardSelect = document.getElementById('patientWard');
          if (wardSelect && appState.ward) wardSelect.value = appState.ward;

          const bedInput = document.getElementById('patientBed');
          if (bedInput && appState.bed) bedInput.value = appState.bed;

          const deliverySelect = document.getElementById('patientDeliveryType');
          if (deliverySelect && appState.deliveryType) deliverySelect.value = appState.deliveryType;

          const districtSelect = document.getElementById('patientDistrict');
          if (districtSelect && appState.district) districtSelect.value = appState.district;

          if (appState.babyPhoto) {
            const preview = document.getElementById('babyPhotoPreview');
            if (preview) preview.src = appState.babyPhoto;
          }
        }
      } catch (e) {
        console.error('Storage load error:', e);
      }
    }

    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
      loadState();
      updateTrackerUI();
      updateFlowMonitoringUI();
      updateCareStatusUI();
      renderThaiMedApptUI();
    });
  </script>
</body>
